ExpenseTracker 1.0.0

This product includes open-source software maintained by its respective authors
and contributors, including AndroidX and Jetpack Compose, SQLCipher, Tink,
Apache Commons CSV and Compress, FastExcel, MapLibre Native, Vico, ACRA,
OkHttp, Kotlin, Room, Coil, Bouncy Castle, ICU and their transitive dependencies.

The exact version, package URL and declared license for every locked third-party
component is generated from the release CycloneDX graph by:

    ./gradlew generateLicenseReport

The resulting files are:

    build/reports/dependency-license/licenses.csv
    build/reports/dependency-license/index.html
    build/reports/dependency-license/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt

Copyright and license rights remain with each upstream project. The generated
inventory identifies the source distribution from which complete license and
copyright text can be obtained. No dependency is accepted with unresolved
license metadata by the P36 release gate.
